1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,575
Devices to quote.

2
00:00:01,575 --> 00:00:04,557
Satire: a bull with a mosquito net.

3
00:00:04,557 --> 00:00:09,505
Irony: every symptom Laxminarayan reports is true of a corpse.

4
00:00:09,505 --> 00:00:13,606
Comic exaggeration: dearer than my wife and children.

5
00:00:13,606 --> 00:00:17,890
Dramatic irony: we know the bull is dead and the king does not.

6
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:20,976
Contrast: a mattress against straw.

7
00:00:20,976 --> 00:00:24,674
And comic reversal: the system rewards pretence.

